{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39173","headline":"对梨花赠皇甫秀才 · 韦庄","name":"对梨花赠皇甫秀才","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"林上梨花雪压枝，独攀琼艳不胜悲。\n依前此地逢君处，还是去年今日时。\n且恋残阳留绮席，莫推红袖诉金巵。\n腾腾战鼓正多事，须信明朝难重持。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39173.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39173","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}